# 🎯 CO-PILOT PAGES: OUTCOME-FOCUSED REFACTOR PLAN
## From Feature Dumps to Outcome-Focused Pages

**Created:** 2024-12-19  
**Status:** 🟢 READY - Surgical Transformation Plan  
**Problem:** Co-pilot pages are feature/functionality focused, dumping too much technical detail  
**Solution:** Transform to outcome-focused pages using product page pattern

---

