## 🎯 TRANSFORMATION STRATEGY

### **New Co-Pilot Page Structure (NO TABS):**

```
/platform/[coPilotSlug]
├── Hero Section (ProductHeroSection)
│   ├── Outcome-focused headline
│   ├── Simple description
│   └── CTA to demo
│
├── Problem Section (ProblemSolutionSection)
│   ├── What problem does this solve?
│   └── 3 simple cards
│
├── Solution Section (ProblemSolutionSection)
│   ├── How does this solve it?
│   └── 3 simple cards
│
├── Outcomes Section (NEW - Simplified, PROMINENT)
│   ├── Key metrics (from observedOutcomes)
│   ├── Real-world results
│   └── Visual proof
│
├── Interactive Demo (NEW - Simplified)
│   └── Live capability showcase
│
└── Technical Details (Collapsed by default)
    ├── Technology Foundation (from Battle Plan tab)
    ├── Core Capabilities (from Strategic Doctrine)
    ├── Advanced Features (collapsed)
    ├── In-Silico Workflow (collapsed)
    └── Value Proposition (collapsed)
```

**Key Changes:**
- ✅ **Remove tabbed interface** - Single page flow, no tabs
- ✅ **Battle Plan content repurposed** - Move Technology Foundation to collapsed Technical Details
- ✅ **Strategic Doctrine content repurposed** - Core Capabilities, Advanced Features → collapsed Technical Details
- ✅ **Outcomes PROMINENT** - Move from buried/collapsed to main page flow
- ✅ **Problem → Solution → Outcomes** - Clear narrative flow before technical details

