## 📋 CONTENT TRANSFORMATION RULES

### **Hero Headline Rules:**

**❌ BAD (Feature-focused):**
- "Biology-Aware Drug Ranking"
- "S/P/E Fusion Capability"
- "Advanced Variant Analysis"

**✅ GOOD (Outcome-focused):**
- "Prevent Toxicity Before It Happens"
- "Match Patients to Perfect Trials"
- "Rank Drugs by Biological Fit"

### **Problem Cards Rules:**

**Extract from `coreProblemPoints`:**
- Max 3 cards
- Simple title + description
- Focus on pain points, not technical details

**Example Transformation:**
```
Before: "Too many options, little clarity on fit to tumor biology."
After: {
  title: "Too Many Options",
  description: "Little clarity on which drugs fit tumor biology",
  icon: "search",
  highlight: "Unclear"
}
```

### **Solution Cards Rules:**

**Extract from `observedOutcomes`:**
- Max 3 cards
- Use outcome title + description
- Highlight key metric

**Example:**
```
{
  title: "VUS Resolution",
  description: "73% of uncertain variants become actionable",
  icon: "target",
  highlight: "73% actionable"
}
```

